          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7350302",
      "subQuestName": "Set up the riddles with Drusus",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "735030201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "735030201": {
            "id": "735030201",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Drusus",
            "text": "Okay! Let's set up the second riddle here. Once this riddle is solved, the final chest can be found.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735030202"
            ]
          },
          "735030202": {
            "id": "735030202",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Drusus",
            "text": "I'm going to place the final treasure... there.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735030203"
            ]
          },
          "735030203": {
            "id": "735030203",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735030204"
            ]
          },
          "735030204": {
            "id": "735030204",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Um...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735030205"
            ]
          },
          "735030205": {
            "id": "735030205",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Isn't this just an ordinary little hill with an ordinary little waterfall next to it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735030206"
            ]
          },
          "735030206": {
            "id": "735030206",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Drusus",
            "text": "That's right! But it will soon be anything but ordinary because of our riddles.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735030207"
            ]
          },
          "735030207": {
            "id": "735030207",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Drusus",
            "text": "Okay, Traveler, what do you suggest for this riddle?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735030209",
              "735030212",
              "735030215"
            ]
          },
          "735030209": {
            "id": "735030209",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Drusus",
            "text": "Eh? You think so? Hm... True, the riddle solvers would be pretty tired when they get here...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735030210"
            ]
          },
          "735030210": {
            "id": "735030210",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Drusus",
            "text": "Alright, straightforward it is."
          },
          "735030212": {
            "id": "735030212",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Drusus",
            "text": "Hmm... The waterfall is indeed a very clear theme.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735030213"
            ]
          },
          "735030213": {
            "id": "735030213",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Drusus",
            "text": "No problem, let's use it as a theme. As for the difficulty of this last riddle... Let's tone it down a bit."
          },
          "735030215": {
            "id": "735030215",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey! You're laughing more and more!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735030216"
            ]
          },
          "735030216": {
            "id": "735030216",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "It's done.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735030217"
            ]
          },
          "735030217": {
            "id": "735030217",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Drusus",
            "text": "\"The green umbrella gazes at the pearl curtain.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735030218"
            ]
          },
          "735030218": {
            "id": "735030218",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Drusus",
            "text": "Hm... This riddle sounds special... Did you learn this from somewhere?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7350304",
      "subQuestName": "Set up the treasure with Drusus",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "735030401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "735030401": {
            "id": "735030401",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Drusus",
            "text": "This is the last chest. There's no need for riddles for this one.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735030402"
            ]
          },
          "735030402": {
            "id": "735030402",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Drusus",
            "text": "But what should I put in it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735030404",
              "735030407",
              "735030410"
            ]
          },
          "735030404": {
            "id": "735030404",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Drusus",
            "text": "That makes sense. The content of this chest should be at least worthy of the riddle solver's hard thinking along their journey.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735030405"
            ]
          },
          "735030405": {
            "id": "735030405",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Drusus",
            "text": "Speaking of value, the most logical would be Mora, of course. Ah, I'll just put some Mora in there...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735030413"
            ]
          },
          "735030413": {
            "id": "735030413",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Drusus",
            "text": "Okay, this set of riddles is finished now. Thank you for your help, Traveler.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735030414"
            ]
          },
          "735030414": {
            "id": "735030414",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Drusus",
            "text": "These are for you, as a reward.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735030415"
            ]
          },
          "735030415": {
            "id": "735030415",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Drusus",
            "text": "*sigh* I was planning on discussing riddles with you in more depth, but I have to return to the Akademiya to tend to some matters first.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735030416"
            ]
          },
          "735030416": {
            "id": "735030416",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Drusus",
            "text": "If you discover any strange new riddles in your travels, or get stumped by one, please come to me by all means.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735030417"
            ]
          },
          "735030417": {
            "id": "735030417",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Drusus",
            "text": "We can discuss them in detail together, then... Put together new riddles for other adventurers! Hahaha!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735030418"
            ]
          },
          "735030418": {
            "id": "735030418",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Drusus",
            "text": "Farewell, Traveler. I wish you safe travels.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735030419"
            ]
          },
          "735030419": {
            "id": "735030419",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Drusus",
            "text": "I hope that Treasure Hoarder named Narzam won't cause any serious trouble..."
          },
          "735030407": {
            "id": "735030407",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Drusus",
            "text": "Practical value? Hm... What can be of enough practical value?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735030408"
            ]
          },
          "735030408": {
            "id": "735030408",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Drusus",
            "text": "Oh right! I got a recipe from someone a few days ago. Let's put it in this chest as a reward."
          },
          "735030410": {
            "id": "735030410",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Drusus",
            "text": "Hahahahaha! You're right! So true! The thinking process is indeed a priceless and valuable experience! Compared to it, other things are almost worthless.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735030411"
            ]
          },
          "735030411": {
            "id": "735030411",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That's simply not true! Put some Mora in it, or a recipe! Some vegetables or fruits at the very least, don't put nothing!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735030412"
            ]
          },
          "735030412": {
            "id": "735030412",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Drusus",
            "text": "I'm kidding, I'm kidding. I'll definitely put something in as a reward."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}